                                "sense_id": "c224c725-f4e9-3fce-b508-3c79f3e0443b",
                                "text": "Instead, ask questions from a place of genuine curiosity. Then, and only then, take the time to sculpt your persuasive case, incorporating the answers you discovered. […] What did you learn from your prepersuasive case Q&A?"
